<title>FRANCE: EU adds 200,000 T soft wheat to ACP export quota.</title>
<headline>EU adds 200,000 T soft wheat to ACP export quota.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday added 200,000 tonnes to its quota of free-market soft wheat available for export to African, Caribbean and Pacific nations, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>This brings to 400,000 tonnes the soft wheat total set aside by the EU for export to these destinations since the start of the 1996/97 campaign.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
